All 61 pages were fetched successfully. Note on method: WebFetch hit intermittent HTTP 429 (rate limiting, likely shared across concurrent sessions working this archive in parallel) on several URLs. Retries succeeded for most; for a handful, content was instead extracted by fetching the raw HTML directly with curl and parsing it manually (title, headings, body text, images, links). These are flagged inline in the relevant .md files with a "fetched via direct HTML retrieval" note. No URL was left as **FETCH FAILED** — every one produced usable content.

