Notable finding: many images on this site are served from a `relaunch.dietz.eu` staging subdomain that does not resolve via DNS from this environment. In every case checked, an equivalent copy of the same file was confirmed to also be served from the production `www.dietz.eu` domain at the same path, and that copy was used for downloading/verification instead. This is noted per-page where relevant.

